/F1 9 Tf 50 780 Td (PMFBY Official Portal ? Frequently Asked Questions \(FAQ\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 758 Tm /F2 12 Tf ([SECTION: FAQ Section 1] Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana \(PMFBY\) ? Official Frequently Asked Questions \(Undated Portal Document\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=FAQ Q1-Q3] Q1: What is the premium rate payable by farmers under PMFBY? Answer: Under PMFBY, farmers pay a uniform maximum premium of 2.0% of Sum Insured \(or Actuarial rate, whichever is less\) for all Kharif food grain and oilseed crops; 1.5% of Sum Insured \(or Actuarial rate, whichever is less\) for all Rabi food grain and oilseed crops; and 5.0% of Sum Insured \(or Actuarial rate, whichever is less\) for Annual Commercial and Annual Horticultural crops.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 724 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=FAQ Q4-Q7] Q4: Within how many hours must a farmer report localized crop loss or post-harvest damage? Answer: The insured farmer must intimate localized calamity losses \(hailstorm, landslide, inundation, cloudburst\) or post-harvest losses within 72 hours of the occurrence of the peril. Post-harvest losses are covered for a maximum period of 14 days \(2 weeks\) from harvesting for crops left in cut-and-spread condition in the field for drying.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 708 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=FAQ Metadata Note] Temporal Provenance Note: The official PMFBY FAQ web page \(https://pmfby.gov.in/faq\) does not carry an explicit publication date or effective-from date stamp on the document itself.) Tj
